Project:      libirecovery
Upstream:     https://github.com/libimobiledevice/libirecovery
Base commit:  95dec3aa25b1e30654ca107eb971971f6a216520
Licence:      LGPL-2.1-only (COPYING is the LGPL-2.1 text; the source headers say "version 2.1" with no
